Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.43,0:05:28.43,Label,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}WEEKLY 1-ON-1 CALL WITH ME
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.83,0:05:38.33,Label,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}4 WEEKLY COACHING CALLS
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.73,0:05:50.03,Label,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}MY PERSONAL PHONE NUMBER
Dialogue: 2,0:06:10.10,0:06:19.20,Label,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)}APPLY BELOW {\fnInter Display}↓{\fnUnbounded SemiBold}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,18 million people viewed\Nmy product in one month
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.60,0:00:05.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,and from that, I only made
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,$87 in sales.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.43,0:00:09.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,I owed money to my mom
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,my friends were\Ncalling me an idiot
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.53,0:00:13.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I was this close\Nto believing them.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.99,0:00:16.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then, I changed\Nthree simple things
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,but I still ran the same products
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.33,0:00:23.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,I didn't run ads, but I made\N$10,000 in just three days.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.75,0:00:24.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.05,CapS,,0,0,0,,I'll even show you live
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.97,CapS,,0,0,0,,because if I can't\Nshow you live
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.97,0:00:30.08,CapS,,0,0,0,,then I shouldn't\Nshow you at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.14,CapS,,0,0,0,,And as you can see,\Nit's still here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.14,0:00:32.20,CapS,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,by the end of this video
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.82,0:00:37.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you the three\Nthings that I personally used to take
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,a store from $0 to $10,000\Nin just three days.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.74,0:00:45.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,And one of them is probably the\Nreason that you still haven't gotten
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.90,0:00:46.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,your first sale.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.96,0:00:49.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Because maybe you already\Ntried dropshipping before
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,you spent hours\Nlooking for a product
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,you spent hours recording
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.60,0:00:54.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,you made the videos,\Nyou posted them
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.72,0:00:57.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,and you only got a\Ncouple thousand views.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.52,0:00:59.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then, one video finally pops.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.80,0:01:01.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,You get a million views
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,but you check Shopify at 2am
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.27,0:01:04.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,waiting for your first sale
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,and still, after a million views
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.62,0:01:07.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,you made
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.54,0:01:10.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you haven't\Neven started yet
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.74,0:01:13.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,because every guru is telling\Nyou that you need to run ads.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.94,0:01:15.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,The truth is, you don't.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.66,0:01:19.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,And either way, whatever misconception\Nyou've been led to believe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.69,0:01:23.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,The problem is the\Nplatform you're posting on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.30,0:01:27.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Because the apps everybody is telling\Nyou to post on are kind of saturated
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,and really difficult\Nto go viral on.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.86,0:01:34.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,The place to actually go\Nviral and get sales is
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.93,0:01:40.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to tell you\Nexactly where that was.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.91,0:01:45.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,But not that long ago, I was working\Nat a dining server for $16 an
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.59,0:01:46.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,hour.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.03,0:01:48.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every shift, my co-workers\Nwere making fun of me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,my managers were complete jerks
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.84,0:01:54.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,and even one time, a grown\Nman threatened me at work.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.76,0:01:58.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,I remember walking out of there\Nthinking every single night that I
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.14,0:02:01.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,can't do this anymore and I'm not\Ngoing to live the rest of my life
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.40,0:02:04.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,working as a dining server\Nat a retirement home.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.34,0:02:04.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I decided to go\Nall in on dropshipping.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,When I told my cousins and my\Nclosest friends that I was going to
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,go all in on dropshipping
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.50,0:02:17.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,they literally made\Nfun of me and they said
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.71,0:02:20.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,bro, you're falling\Nfor the TikTok scams.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.71,0:02:22.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,I took every dollar I had
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,spent $1,500 on a mentor
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.93,0:02:27.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,and he gave me the\Nworst advice ever.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.37,0:02:28.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I started teaching myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.87,0:02:31.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,I covered my entire wall in notes
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.03,0:02:33.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I tested product after\Nproduct after product.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.71,0:02:36.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I even ran 40\Ndifferent products
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.29,0:02:39.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I still made only\Na couple hundred bucks.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.45,0:02:40.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,And one finally went viral.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.87,0:02:41.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,I got
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.43,0:02:43.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,but I only made
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,By then, I was $500\Nin debt to my mom
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.15,0:02:50.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,and she said, Ricky, I don't think\Nyou should be doing this anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.45,0:02:52.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,You should go back to working\Nat the retirement home.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.91,0:02:55.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,And that was the fuel\Nthat I needed to say
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.13,0:02:55.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,you know what?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.77,0:02:58.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do everything in\Nmy power to make this work.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.45,0:02:59.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I did.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.43,0:03:02.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,But honestly, I started to think\Neverybody was right about me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.85,0:03:04.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,And if that's where\Nyou are right now
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.87,0:03:06.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,please do not click\Noff of this video
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.87,0:03:10.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,because what happened next is why\NI'm actually making this video now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.95,0:03:14.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,But there was one place that I\Nnever tried that every dropshipper
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.29,0:03:17.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,said to stay away from because only\Nkids watch it and it doesn't convert.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.57,0:03:20.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I tried it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.65,0:03:23.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,I posted one video, and\NI got a million views.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.51,0:03:23.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,As
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.63,CapS,,0,0,0,,soon as I posted\Nmy first video
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.63,0:03:28.05,CapS,,0,0,0,,I was getting hundreds\Nof thousands of views
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.05,0:03:30.81,CapS,,0,0,0,,every single day,\Nuntil finally
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.81,0:03:33.65,CapS,,0,0,0,,I was getting millions of\Nviews every single day.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.65,0:03:36.45,CapS,,0,0,0,,And I've been running the\Nsame channel for over a year
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.45,0:03:36.89,CapS,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.89,0:03:37.04,CapS,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.11,0:03:41.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,that channel made me over $300,000\Nbecause I found out about YouTube
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.17,0:03:43.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Store, where you can\Ntag your products.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.37,0:03:45.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,And ever since I\Nstarted doing that
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.15,0:03:49.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,I started getting sale after\Nsale after sale every single day.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.45,0:03:49.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.75,0:03:52.85,CapS,,0,0,0,,I went back to TikTok and\Nran all of the products that
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.85,0:03:55.11,CapS,,0,0,0,,I ran before that\Ndidn't make me money.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.11,0:03:56.97,CapS,,0,0,0,,And they all\Nstarted printing.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.10,CapS,,0,0,0,,85 million views\Nin 90 days.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.10,0:04:01.50,CapS,,0,0,0,,And this channel went from\Nzero to a quarter million
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.38,CapS,,0,0,0,,views in just two days.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.38,0:04:06.76,CapS,,0,0,0,,This channel got 19 million\Nviews in the very first
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.76,0:04:07.76,CapS,,0,0,0,,month of posting.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.76,0:04:10.90,CapS,,0,0,0,,And this channel got 36\Nmillion views a lifetime.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.90,0:04:13.76,CapS,,0,0,0,,And there are a dozen other\Nchannels that I've run that
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.70,CapS,,0,0,0,,have gotten results\Njust like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.70,0:04:15.90,CapS,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,after my first $10,000 month
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,I started going on vacations
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.84,0:04:22.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,buying my brother\Nthe brand new iPhone
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.12,0:04:25.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,and just doing whatever I\Nwanted to at a very young age.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.46,0:04:28.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,And every single person who\Ntold me to get a real job
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.78,0:04:30.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,I had proven them wrong.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,And that is what I'm\Nmost happy about.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.02,0:04:39.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,Posting on YouTube Shorts is not\Nwhat made me that amount of money.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.09,0:04:42.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,There are dropshippers posting on\NYouTube Shorts every single day
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.26,0:04:44.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,that still aren't\Ngetting any sales.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.28,0:04:47.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,What made the difference was the\Nthree things that I promised you
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.90,0:04:48.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,at the start.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.40,0:04:54.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,that is already proven that\Npeople are going to buy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.91,0:05:01.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,a video, not an ad, a channel that\NI will review every single week.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.09,0:05:04.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,winner.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.39,0:05:08.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,We build a branded store that will\Ncontinue making you money month
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.39,0:05:09.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,after month.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.35,0:05:16.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,We will find your product
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.65,0:05:20.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,make you go viral, and build a\Nstore that will pay you every single
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.55,0:05:21.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,month.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.83,0:05:26.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,your product, and you will leave\Nthe call knowing exactly what you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.89,0:05:28.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,need to do for the next week.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,where we go over product research
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.87,0:05:34.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,competitor research, videos
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.93,0:05:38.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,and Q &As where you can ask me\Nany questions that you have.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.13,0:05:46.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,not an assistant, my actual phone\Nnumber so that you can ask me any
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.11,0:05:49.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,question that you want whenever you\Nfeel stuck or you need some more
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.45,0:05:50.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,guidance.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.13,0:05:52.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you do the work and you're\Nnot live with a product
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.71,0:05:54.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,a store, and a channel in the next
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.53,0:06:02.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,I take every call myself and I only\Nwork with a small group of people
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.37,0:06:02.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,at a time.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you're tired of\Ngetting zero views
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.94,0:06:08.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,not getting any sales, the\Napplication is down below.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.44,0:06:11.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,And then we will look at your\Nproduct and your store live and point
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.96,0:06:15.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,you in the right direction and\Ntell you the price straight up.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.00,0:06:17.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,If it's not a fit, you'll know\Nwithin a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,I will see you inside.
